**Critical requirement: eliminate popup-only articles.**

Every post must have its own stable, directly accessible URL. Users and search engines must be able to open, refresh, share and index each article independently.

Use the existing routing framework. Prefer clean URLs such as:

`/knowledge-hub/emirates-id-renewal-guide/`

